  "releaseNotes": "1.0.10:\n  NuGet icon\n  - Added the new TestKit package icon to published packages\n  - Embedded package readme and repository metadata consistently across packages\n\n  Release workflow alignment\n  - Switched publishing from push-to-master to GitHub Release / workflow_dispatch\n  - Added release-tag-based version resolution (vX.Y.Z)\n  - Matched the pack → artifact upload → deploy flow used in the other TALXIS package repos\n\n  Deployment fix\n  - Switched NuGet publishing to OIDC-based login, matching the working TALXIS release pattern used in tools-devkit-build\n  - Kept the explicit build-then-pack flow that succeeds on GitHub's Windows runner\n\n1.0.9:\n  NuGet icon\n  - Added the new TestKit package icon to published packages\n  - Embedded package readme and repository metadata consistently across packages\n\n  Release workflow alignment\n  - Switched publishing from push-to-master to GitHub Release / workflow_dispatch\n  - Added release-tag-based version resolution (vX.Y.Z)\n  - Matched the pack → artifact upload → deploy flow used in the other TALXIS package repos\n\n  Packaging fixes\n  - Moved to unified 1.0.9 package versioning across TestKit packages\n  - Updated Bindings to pack cleanly with the Selectors projects from the same solution\n  - Fixed the Windows release workflow to build first, then pack with --no-build\n\n1.0.8:\n  NuGet icon\n  - Added the new TestKit package icon to published packages\n  - Embedded package readme and repository metadata consistently across packages\n\n  Release workflow alignment\n  - Switched publishing from push-to-master to GitHub Release / workflow_dispatch\n  - Added release-tag-based version resolution (vX.Y.Z)\n  - Matched the pack → artifact upload → deploy flow used in the other TALXIS package repos\n\n  Packaging fixes\n  - Moved to unified 1.0.8 package versioning across TestKit packages\n  - Updated Bindings to pack cleanly with the Selectors projects from the same solution\n  - Fixed the publish workflow to pack each publishable project explicitly on Windows\n\n1.0.7:\n  NuGet icon\n  - Added the new TestKit package icon to published packages\n  - Embedded package readme and repository metadata consistently across packages\n\n  Release workflow alignment\n  - Switched publishing from push-to-master to GitHub Release / workflow_dispatch\n  - Added release-tag-based version resolution (vX.Y.Z)\n  - Matched the pack → artifact upload → deploy flow used in the other TALXIS package repos\n\n  Packaging fixes\n  - Set the shared package version baseline to 1.0.7\n  - Updated Bindings to pack cleanly with the Selectors projects from the same solution\n  - Removed the stale package icon wiring from the Bindings project in favor of shared package metadata",
